{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Here is a list of the numbers of fish that Tyler caught in nine outings last summer: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b7acd21d15b3e6744a3b750c1c6fbd688b75635.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2,0,1,3,0,3,3,1,2.\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" /> Which statement about the mean, median, and mode is true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/1/de1ddaa1c1ae32f4683701ace87e2adcc36664a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{median} &lt; \\text{mean} &lt; \\text{mode} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{mean} &lt; \\text{mode} &lt; \\text{median} \\\\ \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{mean} &lt; \\text{median} &lt; \\text{mode} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{median} &lt; \\text{mode} &lt; \\text{mean} \\\\ \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{mode} &lt; \\text{median} &lt; \\text{mean}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"460\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, put the numbers in increasing order.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/7/3d76e96d7a46a5eacd2956de74936b866cd03a45.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0,0,1,1,2,2,3,3,3\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/f/85fc9b69a08f09dccf26d426bd41d5f3c1e2b3df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{0+0+1+1+2+2+3+3+3}{9} = \\frac{15}{9},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"314\" height=\"37\" /> the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1d1407aac4125d6c453a365eb173d96ebb48e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> and the mode is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93032f1ab8b685d84a767a2fde0d9006a464b5e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> Because, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef06aa91eab0e16e8b3e886cc5ce1066eaf5feab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{9} &lt; 2 &lt; 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" /> the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d214ac1b703bf5cd542e879a6c02c40483667ef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{mean} &lt; \\text{median} &lt; \\text{mode}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"225\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/T9V6PXgaheI\">https://youtu.be/T9V6PXgaheI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b